Package: deployweb
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, bash-shlib, pnpm, rsync, openssh-client, apache2
Description: Website deployment utility
 deployweb is a utility for deploying websites to remote servers.
 It finds the project root, builds using pnpm, syncs files via rsync,
 and configures Apache virtual hosts.

